# NOTE: Vercel's uploader also honours .gitignore, so anything gitignored must be
# re-included here explicitly. The database snapshot is gitignored (a 20MB binary
# that goes stale immediately) but is REQUIRED in the function bundle - omitting it
# is what took production down: the API cannot start without it.
!data/pmvl-snapshot.db

apps/
services/worker/
tests/
docs/
.venv/
data/pmvl.db
data/pmvl.db-wal
data/pmvl.db-shm
data/raw/
data/processed/
